WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.501
-Welcome back to the show,
everybody.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:05.033
Today is National Pasta Day.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
National Pasta Day.

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.100
And this week is Disney's
100-year anniversary.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.000
So in honor of that, I thought
we'd play a brand-new game.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.133
It's time for
"Can You Lady and the Tramp

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:16.000
This Bowl of Pasta?"

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.367
-♪ Can You Lady and the Tramp
This Bowl of Pasta? ♪

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:26.033
-Alright.
Now let's meet our two couples.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.067
Come on over, everybody!

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.834
Nice to see you.
-Hi!

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.267
-Hi. Patricia.
-Arturo.

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:34.133
-Arturo.
Where are you guys from?

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.133
-Originally from the
Philippines, but I live here.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.767
-Hey!
-Yes. Philippines.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:39.868
-Philippines. Alright.
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:41.534
Okay. Now, what is your name?
-Marcella.

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:42.767
-Marcella.
-Michael.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.067
-Michael.
Where are you guys from?

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.467
-Little Neck, Queens.
-Hey! There you go! Alright.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.734
Very good. Welcome.
Here's how the game works.

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:50.901
Each of you has a bowl of pasta
on the table in front of you

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:53.567
that you have to eat with
your hands behind your back.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.100
Once you've both
cleaned your plate,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.567
you'll move on
to the final round,

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:57.934
where each couple
will have to

00:00:57.934 --> 00:01:01.200
"Lady and the Tramp
a single strand of pasta

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.534
until you're kissing.

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.534
Roots, can we --
can we have a little, uh...

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:08.400
Because the first couple
to connect their lips

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.601
wins the opportunity to
experience the lights of Venice,

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:14.200
the sounds of Naples,
the aromas of Tuscany...

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.100
when they are whisked away

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.367
to the enchanting Olive Garden
at Times Square on us.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:20.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:22.300
-Whoo! Whoo!
Yes!

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.467
-Alright, players.

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:28.767
On the count of three.
One. Two. Three.

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.200
A-mangia.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.334
Okay, there you go.
This is exciting.

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.567
This is exciting.
Okay. Alright.

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:39.267
This is taking longer than we
think. There's a lot of pasta.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.133
Get in the same bowl.
That's what the dogs...

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:47.234
I think you're good.
Over there...

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:50.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:54.767
♪♪

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:59.334
♪♪

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.300
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:07.901
♪♪

00:02:07.901 --> 00:02:11.067
We have a winner. Right over
here. Congratulations!

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:14.267
That was close!

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.434
Please enjoy a fully funded trip
to the heart of Italy,

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.334
conveniently located
in Times Square.

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:22.367
Olive Garden on the corner of
7th Avenue and 47th Street.

00:02:22.367 --> 00:02:23.934
Happy Pasta Day.
Stick around.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:26.467
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

